---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | KRIYANO"
  description="Read the KRIYANO Terms of Use for website access, AI prompts, tools, content, downloads and third-party services."
>
  <section class="pt-[100px] pb-[70px] border-b border-line bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_20%,rgba(183,255,74,0.08),transparent_30%),var(--bg)]">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="mt-[16px] max-w-[850px] text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,5.8rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.055em]">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="max-w-[760px] mt-[26px] text-muted text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.75]">These Terms of Use explain the conditions that apply when accessing or using KRIYANO, including its tools, prompts, guides, downloads and other website content.</p>
      <p class="mt-[20px] text-lime text-[0.75rem] font-black tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-[85px] md:py-[110px]">
    <div class="container grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,820px)] gap-0">
      <article class="grid gap-[48px] md:gap-[34px]">
        {[
          {title:'1. Acceptance of these terms',body:'By accessing or using KRIYANO, you agree to use the website in accordance with these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with these terms, you should discontinue use of the website.'},
          {title:'2. Purpose of KRIYANO',body:'KRIYANO provides practical AI tools, prompts, workflows, guides and educational resources intended to help users apply artificial intelligence to real-world tasks. Content is provided for general informational, educational and productivity purposes.'},
          {title:'3. AI-generated outputs',body:'KRIYANO may help users create prompts or structured instructions for use with third-party artificial intelligence platforms. Artificial intelligence systems can produce inaccurate, incomplete or inappropriate results. Users are responsible for reviewing, verifying and deciding how any AI-generated output is used. KRIYANO does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, suitability or reliability of results produced by external AI systems.'},
          {title:'4. Professional decisions',body:'Information, prompts and tools provided by KRIYANO should not be treated as professional legal, medical, financial, tax, regulatory or other specialist advice. Users should obtain appropriate professional advice when a decision requires specialist knowledge or may create significant legal, financial, health, safety or regulatory consequences.'},
          {title:'5. User responsibilities',body:'Users are responsible for the information they enter into KRIYANO tools and for how they use prompts, outputs, templates, downloads or other materials obtained through the website. Users should avoid entering confidential, sensitive, proprietary or personally identifiable information unless they understand how that information may be processed by the services they choose to use.'},
          {title:'6. Acceptable use',body:'You may not use KRIYANO in a way that intentionally disrupts the website, attempts to gain unauthorised access to its systems, abuses website resources or violates applicable law. Automated scraping, copying or extraction that places an unreasonable load on the website or attempts to reproduce substantial portions of KRIYANO without permission may be restricted.'},
          {title:'7. Intellectual property',body:'Unless otherwise stated, the KRIYANO website design, original written content, branding, prompt structures, tools, guides and downloadable materials are owned by or provided through KRIYANO. Users may use publicly available prompts and tools for their own personal or business tasks, subject to any additional terms shown with a specific resource. Republishing, reselling or presenting substantial KRIYANO content as your own original work may require permission.'},
          {title:'8. Third-party platforms and links',body:'KRIYANO may reference or link to third-party AI platforms, websites, products, software or services. KRIYANO does not control those services and is not responsible for their availability, policies, security, pricing, outputs or content. Use of third-party services is subject to the terms and policies of those providers.'},
          {title:'9. Downloads and digital resources',body:'KRIYANO may provide downloadable templates, guides, prompt packs or other digital materials. Additional licence, payment or usage conditions may apply to certain free or paid resources and will be stated where relevant.'},
          {title:'10. Advertising and affiliate links',body:'KRIYANO may display advertisements or use affiliate links in the future. Where appropriate, commercial relationships or affiliate links may be disclosed in accordance with applicable requirements.'},
          {title:'11. Availability of the website',body:'KRIYANO aims to keep the website available and functioning properly, but uninterrupted access cannot be guaranteed. Features, pages, tools or services may be modified, suspended or removed when necessary for maintenance, improvement or other operational reasons.'},
          {title:'12. Limitation of liability',body:'To the extent permitted by applicable law, KRIYANO is not responsible for losses or damages resulting from reliance on website content, AI-generated outputs, third-party services or decisions made using information obtained through the website. Users remain responsible for evaluating whether a tool, prompt, workflow or output is appropriate for their particular situation.'},
          {title:'13. Changes to these terms',body:'These Terms of Use may be updated as KRIYANO introduces new tools, downloads, paid products, advertising, accounts or other features. The latest version will be published on this page with an updated revision date.'},
          {title:'14. Contact',body:'Questions about these Terms of Use can be submitted through the contact information provided on the KRIYANO website.'},
        ].map((section,i)=>(
          <section key={i} class={i === 13 ? '' : 'pb-[40px] border-b border-line md:pb-[32px]'}>
            <h2 class="text-text text-[1.375rem] leading-[1.3] mb-[18px]">{section.title}</h2>
            {section.body.split('\n\n').map((p,j)=>(
              <p key={j} class="text-muted text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8]">{p}</p>
            ))}
          </section>
        ))}
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
